  "scopeLimits": [
    "Three DELETE routes only; shared helpers, policies and migrations are unchanged.",
    "Required administrative actors establish MFA through real HTTP login/enrollment/TOTP in the same family; optional local controls use ordinary login. Negative fixture SQL removes factor/proof only.",
    "Directed reader SELECT-versus-DELETE control covers unit-memberships only; foreign-scope controls cover all three routes.",
    "Directed cases do not induce real row-lock waits, promotion, capability-loss waits, audit/update triggers or UPDATEzero; those remain pending for these DELETEs.",
    "The separate regression PATCH suite retains its own lock/trigger tests; its PASS is not DELETE lock/trigger coverage.",
    "The preparation wrapper false alert is recorded separately from native child exit0 and is not a product/test RED or retry.",
    "Owned process checks cover the controller's registered direct children; no universal census of other projects or descendant processes is claimed.",
    "Native UTC timestamps are preserved even when their UTC calendar day is08 and the Sao Paulo document date is07.",
    "No browser, Android/iOS, whole API, performance or production acceptance is asserted."
  ],
